[I] Listen to different sounds to improve focus and increase productivity

[T] Blanket is a GTK application for listening to different ambient sounds,
[T] such as rain, wind or a coffee shop, to improve focus and increase
[T] productivity or to fall asleep in a noisy environment. Several sounds
[T] can be mixed with individual volumes.

[U] https://github.com/rafaelmardojai/blanket

